# RepeatEach with ChangeZoneTable$ (RepeatEachEffect.java:84-86, :202-205):
# every player gets a 1/1 Cat per untapped Forest they control. Casting taps
# three of the human's five Forests, so the human makes two Cats and the AI one;
# the loop's tokens share one table, whose batched ChangesZoneAll fires after it.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 G
tapformana human 3 G
tapformana human 4 G
queue paygeneric G
castspell human 1
resolvestack
